<title>PHILIPPINES: PNCC 1996 net surges.</title>
<headline>PNCC 1996 net surges.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gross Revenues (billion)   2.056 vs 1.125</p>
<p>    Net income		   251.508 vs 38.517</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine National Construction Corp. A company official attributed the higher net income to new construction ventures entered into by the company.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
